ld #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bead_create_time.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/bead_create_time.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-fc[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-fc/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared bead time presentation module[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]presentation[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]presentation: add src/sase/bead_time_presentation.py as the single [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source of bead instant and age rendering (glyphs, teal accent, absolute [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]labels, compact age labels, Rich chips, ANSI CLI cells), with honest [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]placeholders for unparseable values and a patchable clock indirection, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus unit tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bead CLI detail, list, search, and dependency surfaces[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after presentation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: add a CREATED section to sase bead show, a created-age cell to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compact list and search rows, and created context to dependency [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list/tree rows, then pin the test clock and regenerate the affected CLI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]golden files.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Task triage gate payload, preview, and validation[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]gate[dim] · [di